From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Nelson Gill <ngill@slack-corp.com>
Date: Tue, 1 Sep 2026 11:20:57 -0700
Subject: fix: restore snap-compatible SNI bus name and dbusmenu path

Chromium changed the StatusNotifierItem well-known bus name from
org.kde.StatusNotifierItem-{PID} to
org.freedesktop.StatusNotifierItem-{PID}-{service_id} and the dbusmenu
object path from /com/canonical/dbusmenu to /org/chromium/DbusMenu in
https://crrev.com/c/8043132.

Under snap strict confinement, the unity7 interface only grants:
  dbus (bind) bus=session name=org.kde.StatusNotifierItem-[0-9]*
and only allows dbusmenu traffic on the /com/canonical/dbusmenu path.

The org.freedesktop prefix and the /org/chromium path are not covered by
any snap interface, causing AppArmor to deny both the bus name
registration (making the tray icon invisible) and the menu export
(breaking the context menu) for all Electron snap apps.

The SNI specification and all known StatusNotifierWatcher implementations
accept either prefix. Restoring the org.kde prefix and canonical dbusmenu
path matches what Chromium <151 used and is compatible with all desktop
environments.

This patch can be removed after snapd ships support for the new paths
(https://github.com/canonical/snapd/pull/17415) and sufficient adoption
time has passed.

Upstream snapd bug: https://bugs.launchpad.net/snapd/+bug/2161950

diff --git a/chrome/browser/ui/views/status_icons/status_icon_linux_dbus.cc b/chrome/browser/ui/views/status_icons/status_icon_linux_dbus.cc
index 2df83ab250e271826e5c84687ae1e929557898a5..f93fd16dba879358b57011c224a3673a9c5bd974 100644
--- a/chrome/browser/ui/views/status_icons/status_icon_linux_dbus.cc
+++ b/chrome/browser/ui/views/status_icons/status_icon_linux_dbus.cc
@@ -71,7 +71,10 @@ const char kInterfaceStatusNotifierWatcher[] = "org.kde.StatusNotifierWatcher";
 // Object paths.
 const char kPathStatusNotifierItem[] = "/StatusNotifierItem";
 const char kPathStatusNotifierWatcher[] = "/StatusNotifierWatcher";
-const char kPathDbusMenu[] = "/org/chromium/DbusMenu";
+// Restore the canonical dbusmenu path for snap confinement compatibility.
+// Chromium moved this from /com/canonical/dbusmenu in https://crrev.com/c/8043132
+// but snap's unity7 AppArmor rules only allow the canonical path.
+const char kPathDbusMenu[] = "/com/canonical/dbusmenu";

 // Methods.
 const char kMethodNameHasOwner[] = "NameHasOwner";
@@ -607,7 +610,11 @@ void StatusIconLinuxDbus::OnHostRegisteredResponse(
   service_id_ = NextServiceId();

   service_name_ =
-      base::StrCat({"org.freedesktop.StatusNotifierItem-",
+      // Use org.kde prefix for snap confinement compatibility.
+      // Chromium changed this from org.kde in https://crrev.com/c/8043132
+      // but snap's unity7 AppArmor rules only allow org.kde.StatusNotifierItem-*.
+      // Can be removed after snapd ships https://github.com/canonical/snapd/pull/17415
+      base::StrCat({"org.kde.StatusNotifierItem-",
                     base::NumberToString(base::Process::Current().Pid()), "-",
                     base::NumberToString(service_id_)});

